    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025660/extras/4698f6edb2e6421cffab2f34637fdced.poster.avif?t=1743824670\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025660/extras/4698f6edb2e6421cffab2f34637fdced.webm?t=1743824670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong> What makes Trust No Bunny different from other social deduction games:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Players are never eliminated. Everybody plays until the end of the game<br></li><li>Card playing and resource management. Figuring out the traitors does not guarantee victory!<br></li><li>Secondary objectives. Winning as innocent townsfolk requires completing multiple objectives<br></li><li>Play against others or bots<br></li><li>Hundreds of costumes and emotes to earn <br></li><li>Rabbits</li></ul><br>Trust No Bunny is being continuously developed by two brothers, Christian and Daniel. We have a great burgeoning community over at our Discord, and are always willing to teach new players! Drop by and say hi.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025660/extras/4698f6edb2e6421cffab2f34637fdced.poster.avif?t=1743824670\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2025660/extras/4698f6edb2e6421cffab2f34637fdced.webm?t=1743824670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><strong> What makes Trust No Bunny different from other social deduction games:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Players are never eliminated. Everybody plays until the end of the game<br></li><li>Card playing and resource management. Figuring out the traitors does not guarantee victory!<br></li><li>Secondary objectives. Winning as innocent townsfolk requires completing multiple objectives<br></li><li>Play against others or bots<br></li><li>Hundreds of costumes and emotes to earn <br></li><li>Rabbits</li></ul><br>Trust No Bunny is being continuously developed by two brothers, Christian and Daniel. We have a great burgeoning community over at our Discord, and are always willing to teach new players! Drop by and say hi.",
